  "bio": "Miss H is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Pittsburgh, United States, specializing in the vibrant and dynamic 'newschool' style. She impeccably blends her love for tattoos, beer, beef, and junk, creating eccentric and unique body art. Her expertise and professionalism are evident in her work and she can be contacted for appointments through her website.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, United States"
